### GET /announcements without params
GET http://localhost:3000/announcements

### GET /announcements with search
GET http://localhost:3000/announcements?search=asus

### GET /announcements with sort and page
GET http://localhost:3000/announcements?sort=oldest&page=1

### GET /announcements/:id existing
GET http://localhost:3000/announcements/1

### GET /announcements/:id non-existing
GET http://localhost:3000/announcements/999999

### POST /announcements valid
POST http://localhost:3000/announcements
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Продам ноутбук ASUS",
  "description": "Ноутбук у відмінному стані, 16GB RAM, SSD 512GB",
  "price": 18000,
  "category": "sale",
  "contactInfo": "0991234567"
}

### POST /announcements invalid
POST http://localhost:3000/announcements
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Bad",
  "description": "short",
  "price": -5,
  "category": "wrong",
  "contactInfo": "1"
}

### PATCH /announcements/:id partial update
PATCH http://localhost:3000/announcements/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "price": 17000
}

### PATCH /announcements/:id empty body invalid
PATCH http://localhost:3000/announcements/1
Content-Type: application/json

{}

### PATCH /announcements/:id non-existing
PATCH http://localhost:3000/announcements/999999
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "price": 15000
}

### DELETE /announcements/:id existing
DELETE http://localhost:3000/announcements/1

### DELETE /announcements/:id non-existing
DELETE http://localhost:3000/announcements/999999
